.TH VIELOTUS-SETTINGS 1 "October 2026" "VieLotusIM 2.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vielotus-settings \- configuration utility for Sen Viet (VieLotusIM) Vietnamese input method
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vielotus-settings
[\fIOPTION\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBvielotus-settings\fR opens the graphical settings window for Sen Viet (VieLotusIM),
allowing users to configure input method preferences (Telex or VNI, free-tone SEN Flex
composition, Smart Bilingual restoration, consonant abbreviations, and macro expansion)
for IBus and Fcitx5.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-telex\fR
Switch the active input method mode to Telex.
.TP
\fB\-\-vni\fR
Switch the active input method mode to VNI.
.TP
\fB\-\-activate\fR
Save and apply the current input method configuration to the active session.
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR
Print the current configuration values to standard output.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/vielotus/config.env
.RS
User configuration file for VieLotusIM.
.RE
